hadiths[36]{hadithnumber,text}:
"3086","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jibreel aaye aur kaha: Tum apne darmiyan ehl-e-Badr ko kiya samajhte ho? Maine kaha: Hamare behtareen; unhon ne kaha: Isi tarah farishton mein se jo Badr mein hazir hue wo hamare nazdeek behtareen farishte hain."
"3087","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ghar ka parosi ghar ka ghair se zyada haqdar hai."
"3088","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ghar ka parosi shuf'a mein zyada haqdar hai."
"3089","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ghar ka parosi parosi ke ghar ka zyada haqdar hai."
"3090","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mushrikon se apne maalon, apni jaanon aur apni zubanon se jihad karo."
"3091","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah Ansar ko hamari taraf se behtareen badla de, khaas taur par Abdullah bin Amr bin Haram aur Saad bin Ubada ko."
"3092","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Moonchhein kaato aur daarhiyan barhao; Majoosiyon ki mukhalifat karo."
"3093","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne chaand ko logon ke liye waqton ki alamat banaya; pas us ke dekhne par roza rakho aur us ke dekhne par iftar karo; phir agar tum par badal chha jaye to tees din gino."
"3094","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne neki ko us ke das guna se banaya: maheena das maheenon se, aur maheene ke baad chhe din ke roze poore saal ki takmeel hain."
"3095","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne rehmat ko sau hisson mein banaya; apne paas ninyanwe hisse rok liye aur zameen mein aik hissa utara; pas us hisse se makhlooq aik doosre par rehem karti hai yahan tak ke ghodi apna khur apne bachche se utha leti hai is darr se ke use lag jaye."
"3096","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne is ummat ka azab us ki duniya mein rakha hai."
"3097","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne tum par naik qaum ki namaz rakhi hai jo raat ko qayam karte hain aur din ko roza rakhte hain; na gunahgar hain na badkaar."
"3098","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri aankhon ki thandak namaz mein rakhi gayi hai."
"3099","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere liye zameen masjid aur paaki ka zariya banayi gayi hai."
"3100","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere liye har paak zameen masjid aur paaki ka zariya banayi gayi hai."
"3101","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Do jannatein chandi ki hain, un ke bartan aur jo un mein hai chandi ke; aur do jannatein sone ki hain, un ke bartan aur jo un mein hai sone ke; aur logon ke aur apne Rab ko dekhne ke darmiyan Jannat-e-Adan mein us ke chehre par kibriyaai ki chadar ke siwa kuch nahi."
"3102","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum aurton ka jihad Hajj hai."
"3103","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Parosi apne parosi ke shuf'a ka zyada haqdar hai, us ka intezar kiya jayega chahe wo ghayeb ho jab un ka raasta aik ho."
"3104","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Parosi apne saqb ka zyada haqdar hai."
"3105","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Quran buland aawaz se parhne wala sadqa buland aawaz se dene wale jaise hai; aur Quran aahista parhne wala sadqa aahista dene wale jaise hai."
"3106","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Quran mein jhagra kufr hai."
"3107","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ghanti shaitan ke baaje hain."
"3108","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Oont saat ki taraf se hai."
"3109","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jama'at rehmat hai aur tafreeqa azab hai."
"3110","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Juma se Juma tak darmiyan ke gunahon ka kaffara hai jab tak kabeera gunah na kiye jayein."
"3111","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Juma har musalman par jama'at mein wajib haq hai, siwa chaar ke: ghulam, aurat, bachcha ya mareez."
"3112","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Juma us par hai jo azan sune."
"3113","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Juma wajib hai magar aurat, bachche, mareez ya ghulam par.. ..."
"3114","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jinn teen qismon ke hain: aik qism jin ke par hain jin se wo hawa mein urte hain; aik qism saanp aur kutte hain; aur aik qism theherte aur kooch karte hain."
"3115","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jannat tum mein se har aik ke joote ke tasme se zyada qareeb hai; aur aag bhi isi tarah."
"3116","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jannat ki imaarat: aik eent chandi ki aur aik eent sone ki; us ka gaara tez mushk hai; us ke kankar moti aur yaqoot hain; us ki mitti zaafran hai; jo us mein dakhil hoga ne'mat mein rahega, bad-haal nahi hoga; hamesha rahega, marega nahi; un ke kapre purane nahi honge aur un ki jawani fana nahi hogi."
"3117","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jannat talwaron ke saayon tale hai."
"3118","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jannat sone ki eent aur chandi ki eent se hai."
"3119","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jannat ke aath darwaze hain aur aag ke saat darwaze hain."
"3120","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jannat sau darje hai, har do darjon ke darmiyan aasmaan aur zameen jitna faasla hai."
"3121","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jannat sau darje hai, har do darjon ke darmiyan aasmaan aur zameen jitna faasla hai; aur Firdaus jannat ka aala-tareen aur darmiyani hissa hai; us ke upar Rahman ka Arsh hai; aur usi se jannat ki neherein phoot-ti hain; pas jab tum Allah se mango to us se Firdaus mango."
